eli_devex: Mini Node example for websocket streaming + in-stream tool call handling:
```js
const c = new Redwood({ key: process.env.RW });
const ws = await c.chat.stream_ws({ model:'r-infer', tool_calls:true, structured_schema:{ type:'object' } });
ws.on('tool_call', async (call) => {
  const out = await localRiskService(call.args);
  ws.sendToolResult(call.id, out);
});
```

